    "productDescriptionProps": {
      "paragraphs": [
        "Suitable for use in public environments.",
        "The fabric has a silicone-based, water-repellent treatment that stops liquids from seeping in, so they stay on the surface and are easily absorbed with a dry cloth or paper towel.",
        "This cover is made from the bouclé fabric Axvall, a soft and stylish material with a rich and a vibrant character.",
        "Soft, organic shapes with a distinct design language give the furniture an elegant, yet playful expression that works well in many different environments.",
        "Designed to be used together with other pieces in the LILLESÄTER series for a complete look – or to work as a bold solitaire in the room.",
        "The sofa with a pocket spring core and cold-molded foam creates a medium-firm comfort that will last for many years, making it a perfect spot for you to relax.",
        "10-year limited warranty. Read about the terms in the limited warranty brochure."
      ],
